  },
  data: {
    LLM: "1. Deal 12 cards to each player, 4 cards face-up to table\n2. If 3+ Aces on table, reshuffle and redeal\n3. Player to dealer's right plays first, turns proceed anticlockwise\n4. On turn: Play one card to capture matching table card(s) by value\n5. If capture made: Take captured card(s) and played card as trick\n6. If no capture: Played card remains on table\n7. Continue until all cards are played\n8. Last player to capture takes remaining table cards",
    Player: "1. Deal 12 cards to each player, 4 cards face-up to table\n2. If 3+ Aces on table, reshuffle and redeal\n3. Player to dealer's right plays first, turns proceed anticlockwise\n4. On turn: Play one card to capture matching table card(s) by value\n5. If capture made: Take captured card(s) and played card as trick\n6. If no capture: Played card remains on table\n7. Continue until all cards are played\n8. Last player to capture takes remaining table cards",
    objective: 'Score points by capturing cards from the table and achieving specific card combinations. Points awarded for most cards, most cards in a specific suit, and capturing the seven of coins/diamonds (settebello).',
    gameplay: "1. Deal 12 cards to each player, 4 cards face-up to table\n2. If 3+ Aces on table, reshuffle and redeal\n3. Player to dealer's right plays first, turns proceed anticlockwise\n4. On turn: Play one card to capture matching table card(s) by value\n5. If capture made: Take captured card(s) and played card as trick\n6. If no capture: Played card remains on table\n7. Continue until all cards are played\n8. Last player to capture takes remaining table cards",
    keyRules: [
      'Must capture if possible - cannot play a card that could capture without capturing',
      "Can capture single card of matching value OR multiple cards summing to played card's value",
      'A sweep (cappotto) occurs when capturing all table cards at once',
      'Last player to capture any cards takes remaining table cards at end',
      'Play is anticlockwise (traditional for Italian games)',
    ],
